<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="crafting.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="crafting">
    <!-- Tier 2 screen (select_crafting_recipe). PEER of construction (tabs+list+
         lines) but heavier: TWO tab rows (category + subcategory, both string
         list_circularizers) + a recipe list (left) + a recipe-info lines pane
         (#recipe-info, middle, from cached_recipe_info) + an item-info lines pane
         (#item-info, right, wide mode only — nested-category block OR
         format_item_info of the result item; ad-hoc text PENDING the Tier-3
         item-info F.2 component). Curses tab-overflow windowing + breakpoint
         paging dropped for native scroll: UP/DOWN move the list cursor;
         PAGE_UP/DOWN + SCROLL_RECIPE_INFO_* scroll BOTH info panes in lockstep
         (SetScrollTop from the loop, mirroring curses recipe_info_scroll/
         item_info_scroll). All filtering/batch/favorite/build stays on
         input_context + popups; the doc is render-only and handles mouse select. -->
    <div class="panel cg-panel">
        <div class="cg-tabrow">
            <div class="tabs cg-tabs">
                <div class="item tab" data-for="t : cats"
                     data-class-selected="t.selected"
                     data-event-click="on_cat(it_index)" data-rml="t.name_rml"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="cg-craft" data-rml="craft_status_rml"></span>
            <span class="cg-hidden" data-rml="hidden_rml"></span>
        </div>

        <!-- Subcategory tabs: NORMAL mode only (FILTERED/BATCH have none). -->
        <div class="tabs cg-subtabs" data-if="show_subcats">
            <div class="item tab" data-for="t : subcats"
                 data-class-selected="t.selected" data-class-cg-empty="t.empty"
                 data-event-click="on_subcat(it_index)" data-rml="t.name_rml"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="cg-main">
            <div class="cg-list scroll-pane">
                <div class="cg-row" data-for="row : rows"
                     data-class-selected="row.selected"
                     data-event-mouseover="on_select(it_index)"
                     data-event-click="on_select(it_index)"
                     data-rml="row.name_rml"></div>
            </div>

            <div id="recipe-info" class="cg-info scroll-pane">
                <div class="cg-line" data-for="ln : info" data-rml="ln.text_rml"></div>
            </div>

            <div id="item-info" class="cg-item scroll-pane" data-if="wide">
                <div class="cg-line" data-for="ln : item" data-rml="ln.text_rml"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cg-foot" data-rml="keybinds_rml"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
